      "title": "CVE-2025-13462",
      "summary": "The \"tarfile\" module would still apply normalization of AREGTYPE (\\x00) blocks to DIRTYPE, even while processing a multi-block member such as GNUTYPE_LONGNAME or GNUTYPE_LONGLINK. This could result in a crafted tar archive being misinterpreted by the tarfile module compared to other implementations.",
